// @id ovw-inventory
// @tab overview
// @title Machine inventory (Azure VM vs Arc) - inventory is not coverage
// @note Source: resources. Azure VMs microsoft.compute/virtualmachines; Arc servers microsoft.hybridcompute/machines (by type, not name or tag).
// @note ARG indexes supported properties only; missing osType shows as Unknown and stays visible. Inventory counts are not Windows eligibility and not assessment coverage.
// @nodata No Azure VMs or Arc machines in scope.
//#include machines
| summarize machinesCount = count() by machineKind, osType = iff(osType == '', 'unknown', osType), eligibility
| order by machineKind asc, eligibility asc
